### 1. Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### 2. Create a new task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build the MERN Kanban App",
  "description": "Follow the step-by-step guide to build a resume-worthy project.",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### 3. Update a task (Replace :id with an actual ID from step 1 or 2)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### 4. Delete a task (Replace :id with an actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/:id
